@startuml
!include ../shortfall/style.iuml
title generate-list: parsing, aggregation, and snapshot publication
autonumber
participant "mishMash:MishMash" as App
participant "parser:Parser" as Parser
participant "active:ActiveMealPlan" as Active

App -> Parser : parseCommand("generate-list")
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser : parseGenerateList("")
note right of Parser : Dispatch is condensed. Nonblank arguments throw\nMishMashException before a command is created.
create participant "command:GenerateListCommand" as Cmd
Parser -> Cmd : new GenerateListCommand(active)
activate Cmd
Cmd --> Parser : command
deactivate Cmd
Parser --> App : command
deactivate Parser
note over App, Cmd : The inherited confirmationPrompt(book) returns Optional.empty(); no confirmation is requested.
App -> Cmd : execute(book)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> Active : get()
Active --> Cmd : Optional<MealPlan>
alt plan is absent
  note right of Cmd : Log WARNING; no snapshot is published.
  Cmd --> App : "No active meal plan. Use 'generate-plan' first."
else plan is present
  participant "plan:MealPlan" as Plan
  participant "day:DayPlan" as Day
  participant "meal:Recipe" as Meal
  Cmd -> Plan : getDays()
  Plan --> Cmd : days
  loop each day
    Cmd -> Day : getMeals()
    Day --> Cmd : meals
    loop each meal occurrence
      Cmd -> Meal : getIngredients()
      Meal --> Cmd : ingredients
      note right of Cmd : Append ingredients to a local list.
    end
  end
  create participant "generator:GroceryListGenerator" as Generator
  Cmd -> Generator : new GroceryListGenerator()
  activate Generator
  Generator --> Cmd : generator
  deactivate Generator
  Cmd -> Generator : generate(ingredients)
  activate Generator
  note right of Generator
    Validate input; merge quantities by ItemKey(name, unit)
    in a LinkedHashMap using BigDecimal::add.
    Create combined GroceryItems in first-appearance order.
    Return List.copyOf(result); collection and item calls are condensed.
  end note
  Generator --> Cmd : unmodifiable groceries
  deactivate Generator
  Cmd -> Active : setGroceryList(groceries)
  activate Active
  note right of Active : Copy with List.copyOf before assigning\nthe present snapshot. No partial result is stored.
  Active --> Cmd : void
  deactivate Active
  note right of Cmd : Log INFO with occurrence and item counts.
  Cmd --> App : "Grocery list generated. Use 'view-list' to view it."
end
deactivate Cmd
note over App, Active : The caller prints the result and next prompt. RecipeBook is not read or changed by this command.
@enduml
